{
 "suite": "forecast revision: the user ticks the materials, the window is 30 days back and 7 days forward",
 "notes": "Shadow only. The scratch database holds an AAPL forecast made 2026-10-14 and two AAPL materials seeded after it (/tmp/market-g7/seed_shadow.sql): one published 2 days after, one 5 days after (offered only under the 7-day window). GOOGL's forecast (2026-09-27) has one backfilled upload saved by an earlier shadow run; META's forecast has nothing in its window and NVDA has no forecast. There is no forecast worker in the shadow, so a submitted revision stays queued. Run /tmp/market-g7/reset_shadow.sql before a run: a queued revision of the same material is refused by design.",
